PTX CoRR+mixed-size.cta
"A relaxed 32-bit store and two relaxed 16-bit loads of its low half (.cta): can the second load miss what the first saw?"
{
x[0]=0;
x[1]=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0    ;
 st.relaxed.cta.b32 x, 1  | ld.relaxed.cta.b16 r0, x[0] ;
                          | ld.relaxed.cta.b16 r1, x[0] ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
